			"notes": "new enchantments, a staff item, and a big bugfix.\n\nEnchantments:\nFrost (1-3) - Gives the afflicted player ice ticks (makes them slightly more frozen with each hit, as if they were in powdered snow. Ice ticks scale with level.)\nLance (1-2) - Right click enchantment for swords that lets you dash forward when on the ground. Has no cooldown, dash size scales with level.\nFIREBALL IS ONLY APPLICABLE TO THE STAFF NOW!\nstaff is craftable with 2 sticks and an amethyst shard\nthe big bugfix is that the fireball enchantment for some reason gave the fireballs drag, causing them to freeze midair eventually and lag up the server.\nso I learned mixins to modify the fireball class to not have drag (What the fuck, Mojang???)"
